              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قایم شدن (qâyem shodan) — \"to hide (oneself)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بچه ها پشت درخت قایم شدند. Bachche-hâ posht-e derakht qâyem shodand. The children hid behind the tree."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Conversational. qâyem kardan is \"to hide something\". Present qâyem mishavad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "qâyem is usually traced to Arabic qā'im, \"standing, firm\" (EtymDB lists the Arabic word); in Persian it came to mean \"tucked away\". shodan \"to become\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
